OL,3,GNEWSACall for artists to bring dragon
OL,4,Atrail to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtists are being invited to submit
OL,7,Ftheir designs for a major public art
OL,8,Ftrail set to feature dozens of
OL,9,Fcolourful dragon sculptures.
OL,11,FTrail of the Dragons will feature 30
OL,12,Flarge-scale sculptures at key
OL,13,Flandmarks, public spaces and parks
OL,14,Facross Wolverhampton, from 5 July to 5
OL,15,FSeptember 2027.
OL,17,FOrganisers are calling for both
OL,18,Fregional and national artists of all
OL,19,Fabilities to submit their designs for
OL,20,Fthe project, with each sculpture set to
OL,21,Fbe transformed into a "unique work of
OL,22,Fart".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
